 Real numbers $a$ and $b$ satisfy the equations $3^a=81^{b+2}$ and $125^b=5^{a-3}$.  What is $ab$? Level 5 Algebra The given equations are equivalent, respectively, to \[
3^a=3^{4(b+2)}\quad\text{and}\quad 5^{3b}=5^{a-3}.
